"Kenji is 107 at integration and becomes one of Earth's great centennials."
"His friend James dies saving him in the arena bonus round."
"He is famed for killing the Fallen rhino in the arena and the River King at the tower's base."
"The River King tears off his arm, and the arm regrows after his evolution."
"His spear is carved from the Fallen rhino's horn, and a strap shrinks his gear to toy size."
"He organizes thousands of fighters into squadrons for the battle on the tower roof."
"He evolves early with a Species-Experience Pill and gains a head start toward grade C."
"He takes the Rare class Commander and the Profession Warlord."
"His aura Tactical Command paints orders, maps and outlines of allies into their sight."
"He shares Aurora's defense ministry with Ella."
"He crosses the Labyrinth with Nick into the dreadbeast quarantine zone."
"His Heavy Armor mastery makes worn plate and chain weigh half as much."
"He refuses to say what happened when the System jolted his Psi to life."
"He reaches level 50 and chooses an Epic class."
